+
+The bound delegated review identifies its actual `/root/…` reviewer, run, supplier, original obligation and routing consumer, completion and no repair/acceptance/coverage claims. Its `used_clause` must literally occur in the helper archive; every nonempty `consumer_premise_quotes` entry must literally occur in the assigned consumer archive. The proof and use are not certified merely by satisfying a JSON shape: actual root/delegated reading and independent native Alpha adjudication remain necessary. This route freezes actual review evidence and preserves its limitations; it cannot convert a sound first-assertion use into acceptance of an unrelated criterion gap.
+
